{
  "schema_version": "wwybsj_predicate_contract.v1",
  "updated_at": "2026-08-14",
  "note": "Source of truth for every wwybsj predicate's contract. `ontology_relation_type` can only express a SUBSET of this (it has no is_functional column, and its dst_type_id assumes an entity-valued object), and nothing in the database enforces it on semantic_statement — there are no triggers, and upsert-batch does not consult the relation-type table. Enforcement is wwybsj_predicates.py --validate, which reads this file. Registration mirrors what the table can hold, for a canonical queryable contract. L2 的槽位只以本馆文物为主体：主体是通用概念的断言属于 archeology 域，从远端原文抽出来存本地只是换条路径的复制。",
